 draw from the same bucket.\n$1.45\\times$ mean step speedup. Reuse docs/images/density_aware_*.png.}\n\n\\subsection{Inference: link-following generation}\n\\todo{generate.py: after each token, run link detection; resolved links fetch the\ntarget doc into the attention context (retrieval mirroring training);\n--allow-generation-fallback synthesizes unresolved targets.}\n\n\\subsection{Model and training recipe}\n\\todo{Decoder-only transformer, RoPE, bf16, Muon (2D) + AdamW (embeddings/norms),\nweight tying + mid-training untie, squared-ReLU MLP, logit soft-cap; Chinchilla-derived token budgets; DDP via SLURM/submitit.}\n","replaceAll":false,"structuredPatch":[{"lines":["   \\item[\\concat] compute control: connected components merged into one causal","         super-document (most attention, no inference-time linking)."," \\end{description}","-\\todo{Figure: the four masks on one 16k batch (reuse docs/images/mask_*.png).}","+\\todo{Figure: the four masks on one 16k batch (reuse docs/images/mask\\_*.png).}"," \\todo{Formal mask definition (indicator over token pairs).}"," The mask is compiled to a block-sparse form so that fully-masked $128\\times128$ blocks"," are skipped: we build on PyTorch FlexAttention"],"newLines":7,"newStart":21,"oldLines":7,"oldStart":21}],"userModified":false},"type":"user","userType":"external","uuid":"2e84dfc4-ee9a-4259-8166-d680274ec1d6","version":"2.1.227"},"format":"claude-code-jsonl/1"},"recorded_at":"2026-08-11T02:20:11.767Z","schema":"conversation-ledger/v1"}
